# WolkaraForever layer patch 0006 - authorization: retry the local service
#
# Why: the first TCP connection to the local service can fail on a mobile network
# and nothing retried it, so pairing and memory preparation failed for good. The
# retry is generation-guarded and cancellable, and only a helper that reports the
# failure may classify it as retryable.
# Needs: authorization/App/LocalServiceRetry.{h,m} from the layer. The platform
# suites do not compile the authorization sources, so the platform tree still
# builds and tests on its own.
# Applies to: authorization/App/LocalAuthorization.h, LocalAuthorization.m
# Upstream: candidate (not submitted).
#
